# Wild Card (windurst 77): the coffer's Prog operand. Accepted by GM at Prog 1 (the card not held): the key traded to the
# Toraimarai Canal Treasure Coffer is nil, the coffer's own script (a regular opening: gil, no Joker Card). Prog 4 by GM,
# the coffer back after its 180 s: nil again, the coffer's own script, which now answers with its illusion (the cooldown
# the first opening set; the quest's bypass type 2 skips that test, so a quest action here would give the card).
# The Star Onion quests 1-4 completed by GM (an available one's line would otherwise answer at Kohlo-Lakolo first).
lists ToraimaraiCanal/Treasure_Coffer/onTrade
char zone=ToraimaraiCanal pos=-257.5,24.0,82.0 lvl=5 nation=2
rank 8
fame Windurst 325
quest Windurst.TruthJusticeAndTheOnionWay completed
quest Windurst.KnowOnesOnions completed
quest Windurst.InspectorsGadget completed
quest Windurst.OnionRings completed
quest Windurst.CryingOverOnions completed
quest Windurst.WildCard accepted
charvar Quest[2][77]Prog 1
item ToraimariCofferKey
item ToraimariCofferKey
login
tick 13000
trigger Treasure_Coffer
trade Treasure_Coffer ToraimariCofferKey x1    # Prog 1: nil, the coffer's own script
tick 4500
charvar Quest[2][77]Prog 4                     # GM
tick 190000                                    # the coffer hidden 180 s
trigger Treasure_Coffer
trade Treasure_Coffer ToraimariCofferKey x1    # Prog 4: nil, the coffer's own script: the illusion (bypass type 0 within its cooldown)
tick 4500
